{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"جامع الترمذي","section":{"24":"The Book on Clothing"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":1720,"hadithnumber_last":1787,"arabicnumber_first":1720,"arabicnumber_last":1787,"name_native":"كتاب اللباس"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1743,"arabicnumber":1743,"text":"حدثنا قتيبة، حدثنا حاتم بن اسماعيل، عن جعفر بن محمد، عن ابيه، قال كان الحسن والحسين يتختمان في يسارهما . وهذا حديث حسن صحيح","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":24}}]}